flowchart LR
    TEST[HIL test runner] --> BUILD[Build and image generation]
    BUILD --> FLASH[ST-LINK flash adapter]
    FLASH --> MCU[STM32F429 target]
    MCU --> UART[UART observations]
    UART --> TEST
    TEST --> BACKUP[Flash backup]
    TEST --> REPORT[Machine-readable report]
    TEST --> RESTORE[Restore original regions]
    RESTORE --> VERIFY[Read-back verification]
    VERIFY --> REPORT
